      "parent": "pz-eng-c",
      "children": [],
      "settings": {
        "text": "Brand system (4–6 weeks) — fixed-scope quote. Founder interview, positioning, mark, palette, typography, voice document, and a one-page studio brief.\n\nBrand & website (8–10 weeks) — PRIMARY. Brand system + website built to perform. Most owners start here.\n\nTend (retainer) — Monthly. Quarterly content, SEO, performance, direct line to the founder."
